    "category": "equipment",
    "html": "\n\n\n\n<section class=\"content-card special-shield-hero\">\n  <span class=\"guide-kicker\">ARM GUARD SYSTEM</span>\n  <h2>終極臂甲系統</h2>\n  <p>從古代臂甲到世界王專屬神裝，依照職業定位挑選最適合你的防禦與輸出核心。</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"content-card\">\n  <h2> 古代臂甲系列</h2>\n  <p>古代臂甲屬於階段性能力解鎖裝備，強化到指定階段後會提升對應攻擊能力。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"special-shield-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"special-shield-table compact\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>裝備名稱</th>\n          <th>基礎屬性</th>\n          <th>強化階段能力提升</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>\n            <strong class=\"shield-name melee\">古代鬥士臂甲</strong>\n            <span class=\"shield-source\">近戰</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>火 / 水 / 風 / 地屬性防禦 +5</td>\n          <td>\n            <div class=\"shield-stage-list\">\n              <span>+0 額外攻擊點數 +1</span>\n              <span>+5 額外攻擊點數 +2</span>\n              <span>+7 額外攻擊點數 +3</span>\n              <span>+9 額外攻擊點數 +4</span>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>\n            <strong class=\"shield-name ranged\">古代神射臂甲</strong>\n            <span class=\"shield-source\">遠程</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>體力上限 +80</td>\n          <td>\n            <div class=\"shield-stage-list\">\n              <span>+0 遠距離攻擊 +1</span>\n              <span>+5 遠距離攻擊 +2</span>\n              <span>+7 遠距離攻擊 +3</span>\n              <span>+9 遠距離攻擊 +4</span>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"content-card\">\n  <h2> 特殊王裝臂甲系列</h2>\n  <div class=\"special-shield-callout\">\n    <strong>核心機制注意</strong>\n    <p>特殊臂甲安定值皆為 <b>0</b>。每次強化都具風險，但從 +1 起會累加基礎成長，達到 +3 以上後會額外啟動第二段成長能力。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"special-shield-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"special-shield-table boss-shield-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>臂甲名稱</th>\n          <th>基礎能力 +0</th>\n          <th>強化 +1 起<br><span>每強化 +1 累加</span></th>\n          <th>強化 +3 起<br><span>每強化 +1 額外累加</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name fire\">不死鳥臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">不死鳥</span></td>\n          <td>力量 +1<br>近攻 +1</td>\n          <td>PVP 傷害 +1<br>近戰命中 +2</td>\n          <td><b>近戰攻擊 +2</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name earth\">巨蟻女皇臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">異變巨蟻女皇</span></td>\n          <td>防禦 -2<br>遠攻 +2<br>敏捷 +1</td>\n          <td>遠距離攻擊 +1</td>\n          <td><b>敏捷 +2<br>遠距離攻擊 +1</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name sand\">沙蟲臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">沙蟲</span></td>\n          <td>防禦 -2<br>近攻 +2<br>力量 +1</td>\n          <td>近距離攻擊 +1</td>\n          <td><b>力量 +2<br>近距離攻擊 +1</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name earth\">安塔瑞斯臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">地龍</span></td>\n          <td>防禦 -3<br>傷害減免 +4</td>\n          <td>PVP 傷害減免 +1<br>HP +60</td>\n          <td><b>傷害減免 +1<br>魔法防禦 MR +3</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name fire\">巴拉卡斯臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">火龍</span></td>\n          <td>爆擊 +5%<br>力量 +3</td>\n          <td>力量 +1<br>爆擊 +1%</td>\n          <td><b>魔法命中 +3<br>爆擊 +1%</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name water\">法力昂臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">水龍</span></td>\n          <td>魔法爆擊 +5%<br>智力 +3</td>\n          <td>智力 +1<br>魔法爆擊 +1%</td>\n          <td><b>魔法命中 +3%<br>魔法爆擊 +2%</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name wind\">林德拜爾臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">風龍</span></td>\n          <td>遠程爆擊 +5%<br>敏捷 +3</td>\n          <td>敏捷 +1<br>遠程爆擊 +1%</td>\n          <td><b>PVP 傷害 +1<br>遠程爆擊 +1%</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name guard\">守護臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">支配之塔</span></td>\n          <td>防禦 -1<br>傷害減免 +1</td>\n          <td>PVP 減免 +1<br>防禦 -1</td>\n          <td><b>傷害減免 +1</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong class=\"shield-name mage\">法師臂甲</strong><span class=\"shield-source\">支配之塔</span></td>\n          <td>防禦 -2<br>智力 +2</td>\n          <td>魔力恢復量 +5</td>\n          <td><b>魔法命中 +1</b></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n",
